      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Set within one of Wexford’s most desirable modern developments, this impressive home in Manor View enjoys an enviable elevated position with\r\nstunning coastal views stretching towards Wexford Bay and Rosslare  Harbour.  The development is renowned for its contemporary design, \r\nexcellent energy performance and beautifully maintained surroundings.   From the front of the property, the elevated aspect provides panoramic \r\ncoastal and harbour views, while the location places residents just  moments from Wexford Town Centre, bus routes, schools, shops and major \r\nroad connections. It is a setting that combines convenience, lifestyle and  scenery exceptionally well.  Internally, the property is beautifully presented, with a stylish and tastefully decorated interior creating a warm, elegant and welcoming atmosphere throughout. The accommodation is spacious, well proportioned and  thoughtfully laid out, with a natural flow between the living spaces.  A warm entrance hallway with carpeted staircase leads to a versatile ground-floor room, which could be ideally suited as a fourth bedroom, playroom, home office or gym.  The bright and comfortable living room  features double doors opening into a generous kitchen/dining area. The contemporary kitchen is a particular highlight, with a central \r\nisland/breakfast bar providing an ideal space for casual dining, food reparation and entertaining. A useful storage cupboard offers excellent \r\nadditional space for a mini pantry, while French doors open directly onto the patio and large rear garden.  The rear garden is a superb feature of the \r\nproperty, offering excellent privacy, a generous outdoor space and the benefit of not being directly overlooked. A utility room and guest WC \r\ncomplete the ground floor, while a rear door provides convenient access to the garden.  Upstairs, the well-proportioned landing features a useful \r\nstorage cupboard and stair access to the attic. The master bedroom benefits from its own ensuite, while two further double bedrooms enjoy beautiful \r\ncoastal views. A family bathroom completes the first-floor accommodation.   Externally, the property benefits from a smart front garden, private parking for two cars and a gated side entrance providing convenient access to the  rear garden.  This is a superb opportunity to acquire a beautiful, modern and exceptionally well-presented home in a highly sought-after residential setting, combining tasteful interiors, flexible living accommodation, \r\noutstanding coastal views, excellent outdoor space and superb convenience."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall- (5.11m x 2.29m),\tLaminate flooring, carpeted staircase to first floor.\r\nBedroom 4/Playroom – (5.25m x 2.65),\tLaminate flooring, access to attic.\r\nLiving Room – (4.92m x 4.25m),Laminate flooring, double doors to Kitchen/Dining area.\r\nKitchen/Diner – (6.66m x 3.82m),Waist & Eye level units, tiled flooring, part tiled walls, island unit\r\nwith storage and breakfast counter, double doors to living room, french doors to back garden.\r\nUtility – (2.65m x 2.05m), Waist & Eye level units, tiled flooring, plumbed for appliances,\tdoor to rear garden, wc off;\r\nWC – (1.98m x 1.58m), WC, WHB, tiled flooring, part tiled walls.\r\nFIRST FLOOR\r\nLanding\t- (4.27m x 2.34m), Carpet flooring, access to attic, storage press off;\r\nMaster Bedroom -  (4.17m x 3.81m), Carpet flooring, built in wardrobes.\r\nEnsuite\t- (2.69m x 1.53m), WC, WHB, tiled flooring, part tiled walls, double power shower, built\tin storage.\r\nBedroom 2 – (3.79m x 3.89m), Carpet flooring, built in wardrobes, stunning sea views.\r\nBedroom 3 – (2.97m x 2.56m), Carpet flooring, built in wardrobes, stunning sea views.\r\nBathroom – (2.32m x 2.25m), WC, WHB, tiled flooring, tiled around bath, bath with shower over, built in storage shelf. \r\nOutside:  Landscaped enclosed rear garden, 2 parking spaces to the front. \r\nServices: Electricity, mains water, mains sewerage, air to water heating system, triple glazed windows throughout.\r\nBER:  A2 Ber No: 112879093 Performance indicator: 45.6 Wh/m2/yr"
